114	// ======================== 950 SIMT Indirect Fast-Path Lowering
115	// ========================
116	// 1. SIMT Fast-Path Gate
117	//    The SIMT indirect lowering path is enabled only when:
118	//      - compileOn91095Flag && forceSimtTemplateFlag
119	//      - and the access is either:
120	//          * unstructured, or has tag with 'route_discrete_mask_to_simt'
121	//
122	// 2. Op-Specific Lowering
123	//    (1) tt.load / tt.store
124	//        Entry requirements:
125	//          - SIMT fast-path gate enabled
126	//          - tensor rank <= 5, simt template only supports up to 5D tensors for
127	//          now
128	//        Lowering:
129	//          - tt.load / tt.store  -> tt.indirect_load / tt.indirect_store
130	//    (2) tt.atomic_rmw / tt.atomic_cas
131	//        Entry requirements:
132	//          - SIMT fast-path gate enabled
133	//          - offset/value/mask tensors have static shape (required for
